{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped\u00a0on Halloween night in a  chemical plant  after a catastrophic spill, you\u2019re being hunted by something born of mutation and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single player short horror, your only way out is blocked, but every time you push towards your escape, the screeching grind echoes, drawing the creature closer. Timing is everything, so listen for its movements, and if it sees you... Run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Creature Hunts You</strong> \u2013 Something inhuman stalks your every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina Survival</strong> \u2013 Each push drains your strength and alerts the creature; wait for a cooldown and hide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claustrophobic Factory Setting</strong> \u2013 Navigate dim corridors to evade the creature's pursuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Goal: Escape</strong> \u2013 Push the pallet far enough to clear your path\u2026 before it takes you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape? Or will you become the next victim of the <strong>Toxic Harvest</strong>?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3999490/78db03545c823b157ab49e3f9605f49ce1a2f728.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999490?t=1763117295","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999490/3f7a1fb234aedee5f7b43f7c09fea8abb40a7451/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763117295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999490/0e64e4af974655172e0fa2544eba95948f09d4aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763117295","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999490/0e64e4af974655172e0fa2544eba95948f09d4aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763117295","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped\u00a0on Halloween night in a  chemical plant  after a catastrophic spill, you\u2019re being hunted by something born of mutation and madness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this single player short horror, your only way out is blocked, but every time you push towards your escape, the screeching grind echoes, drawing the creature closer. Timing is everything, so listen for its movements, and if it sees you... Run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Creature Hunts You</strong> \u2013 Something inhuman stalks your every move.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stamina Survival</strong> \u2013 Each push drains your strength and alerts the creature; wait for a cooldown and hide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claustrophobic Factory Setting</strong> \u2013 Navigate dim corridors to evade the creature's pursuit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Goal: Escape</strong> \u2013 Push the pallet far enough to clear your path\u2026 before it takes you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to escape? Or will you become the next victim of the <strong>Toxic Harvest</strong>?</p>","developers":["Overthrown Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999490/a5333d752502cf3b0d2920ac4d196ccd9d1da7a7/header.jpg?t=1763117295","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Toxic Harvest\u2122 Overthrow